      "alt": "Starterkit STKa8MPxL",
      "text": "<h1>Arm® Cortex®-A53 based on i.MX8M Plus</h1>\n<p>The Embedded Starterkit STKa8MPxL is an evaluation kit designed for working embedded computing engineers. It's based on the TQMa8MPxL and features an Arm Cortex-A53 processor from NXP. The kit offers advanced audio capabilities with HiFi4 DSP and a Machine Learning Accelerator with 2.3 TOPS performance. It includes an integrated Cortex-M7 and supports high-speed communication through 2x Gbit Ethernet, 1x PCIe, and 2x USB 3.0 interfaces. With low power consumption and integrated security functions, this kit is versatile for various applications requiring complex graphics and data processing.</p>",
      "displayPopupTitle": "true",
      "linkTarget": "_self",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Aug 31 2026 23:49:04 GMT+0000",
      "titleValueFromDAM": "true",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/textwithimage",
      "isDecorative": "false",
